{
  "id": "adobeExportWordExcel",
  "name": "Export Word / Excel — Adobe PDF Services",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuration\n\n1. Créer un projet sur\n   developer.adobe.com/document-services\n   (offre gratuite : 500 conversions / mois,\n   1 conversion = jusqu'à 50 pages).\n\n2. Définir `ADOBE_CLIENT_ID` et\n   `ADOBE_CLIENT_SECRET` dans les variables\n   d'environnement du serveur n8n, puis\n   **redémarrer n8n** : les nœuds **Jeton**,\n   **Asset**, **Export** et **Statut** les lisent\n   via `$env`, il n'y a rien à saisir ici.\n\n3. **Activer** le workflow.\n\nL'URL de production du **Webhook** doit se terminer\npar `/export` sur le même serveur que `/ocr` :\nl'interface la déduit toute seule.\n\nCe workflow ne produit que du **Word**. Le tableur\nest reconstruit dans le navigateur à partir de la\ngéométrie du texte — il ne passe pas par ici et ne\nconsomme aucun quota Adobe.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Lisez-moi",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "export",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        160,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "c8d2f3e4-5a6b-4c7d-9e0f-1a2b3c4d5e6f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://pdf-services.adobe.io/token",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "client_id",
              "value": "={{ $env.ADOBE_CLIENT_ID }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "client_secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.ADOBE_CLIENT_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Jeton",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        360,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://pdf-services.adobe.io/assets",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Jeton').first().json.access_token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "={{ $env.ADOBE_CLIENT_ID }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "mediaType",
              "value": "application/pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Asset",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Le base64 envoyé par le navigateur redevient des octets, car l'envoi vers\n// le stockage Adobe est un PUT binaire brut.\nconst b64 = $('Webhook').first().json.body.pdfBase64 || '';\nif (!b64.startsWith('JVBER')) {          // « %PDF » en base64\n  throw new Error('Le corps de la requête ne contient pas de PDF.');\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {},\n  binary: {\n    data: await this.helpers.prepareBinaryData(\n      Buffer.from(b64, 'base64'), 'source.pdf', 'application/pdf'),\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Binaire",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        760,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "={{ $('Asset').first().json.uploadUri }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData",
        "inputDataFieldName": "data",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Envoi",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://pdf-services.adobe.io/operation/exportpdf",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Jeton').first().json.access_token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "={{ $env.ADOBE_CLIENT_ID }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ assetID: $('Asset').first().json.assetID ?? $('Asset').first().json.assetId, targetFormat: 'docx', ...($('Webhook').first().json.body.ocr ? { ocrLang: 'fr-FR' } : {}) }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Export",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1160,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Export').first().json.headers.location }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Jeton').first().json.access_token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "={{ $env.ADOBE_CLIENT_ID }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Statut",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "done",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "termine"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "failed",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "echec"
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "attente"
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Aiguillage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 2
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "Attendre",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1560,
        400
      ],
      "webhookId": "e9f0a1b2-3c4d-4e5f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.asset.downloadUri }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
      "name": "Telecharger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Le .docx converti repart en base64 dans la réponse du webhook.\nconst bytes = await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(0, 'data');\n\nreturn [{ json: { ok: true, format: 'docx', fileBase64: bytes.toString('base64') } }];"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
      "name": "Sortie",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2000,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Le corps d'un échec Adobe varie ; on aplatit ce qu'on trouve.\nconst s = $input.first().json;\nconst detail = s.error?.message ?? s.error?.title ?? s.message ?? JSON.stringify(s.error ?? s);\n\nreturn [{ json: { ok: false, error: 'Conversion Adobe échouée : ' + detail } }];"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
      "name": "Erreur",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1800,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "firstIncomingItem",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000e",
      "name": "Repondre",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2200,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
